      "sourceTextSha256": "16f8c6abdf11d0b1b73c98bc7dcce7487ee2a869289d00b6a7a3ed8855854340",
      "text": "After breakfast, visit the majestic Uxmal, surrounded by many legends. It is said that the Pyramid of the Magician was built in a single night, and forest guardians – the Aluxes – still “live” in the city. You will see the Governor’s Palace, House of the Turtles, the Pigeon Courtyard, and the Nunnery, all in the unique setting of Uxmal.\n\nTransfer to Merida. Check-in at a 4* hotel.",
